<title>USA: Tecnol Medical Q3 shr $0.11 vs $0.05.</title>
<headline>Tecnol Medical Q3 shr $0.11 vs $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		     8/31/96     9/2/95	     8/31/96  9/2/95</p>
<p>Net sales	 $35,971    $26,283	    $107,553  $89,382</p>
<p>Cost of goods sold 22,374   15,835		62,270   48,362</p>
<p>Gross profit     13,597     10,448		45,283   41,020</p>
<p>Selling expense   5,541	5,761		17,472   16,664</p>
<p>General and administrative:</p>
<p>			3,210	2,073		 7,227    5,897</p>
<p>Research and development:</p>
<p>			  412	  326		 1,273    1,162</p>
<p>Income from operations:</p>
<p>			4,434	2,288		19,311   17,297</p>
<p>Other income (expense),</p>
<p>net		  (1,239)	(714)	     (2,450)  (2,061)</p>
<p>Income before income</p>
<p>taxes		 3,195	1,574		16,861   15,236</p>
<p>Income taxes	1,064	  579		 5,630    5,596</p>
<p>Net income	 $2,131     $  995	     $11,231   $9,640</p>
<p>Net income per shr: $0.11    $0.05		 $0.56    $0.48</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>outstanding	20,164     20,155		20,154   20,107</p>
<p>Note: The company reported significant one-time charges taken in the third quarter for bad debt, obsolete inventory and rebate reserves. Excluding these charges, and a $0.02 per share charge related to the previously announced settlement of a litigation, third quarter net income would have been $4.4 million, or $0.22 per share.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Tecnol Medical Products Inc.</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
